      "params": {
        "text": "Smooth random drift\n\n`random/wanderer2d` is a vec2 source driven by time — same idea as Perlin, but it gives you a coordinate that wanders smoothly around an area.\n\nIdeal for \"natural\" motion: floating particles, eyes, idle animations.",
